<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 6.54 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 6.54 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index fell to 6.54 percent in the week ended April 19 from 6.64 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>WHOLESALE PRICES     Apr 19, 1997  Apr 12, 1997  Apr 21, 1996</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +6.54	   +6.64	   +4.63</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)   322.5	   322.6	   302.7</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended April 21, 1996.</p>
<p>((-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024))</p>
